:[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T23:50:20-07:00","id":528606,"title":"","content":"Thanks for idea - only Page Not Found <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Will check it later then...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T00:09:34-07:00","id":528611,"title":"","content":"The link got borked.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/528342-the-fae-touched?p=528463#post528463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really like these guys. Let me see if I can dig them out of my history....<br /> <br /> EDIT: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ChFsnFToDqIWjTXSFt7jjPtMQfvXE8TdTmenL3Thj98/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Here ya go people.</a> Remember that I love you all, but not as much as the writers of Changeling do.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> (From the other topic)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T11:06:45-07:00","id":528986,"title":"","content":"Okay, read whole <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ChFsnFToDqIWjTXSFt7jjPtMQfvXE8TdTmenL3Thj98/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Fae-Touched preview</a> ( well, beside Promise Merits ) and I think it's cool Proximi/Ghouls level Lesser Templete for the <b>Changeling</b> setting.<br /> <br /> Still, I have in-story objections on using it - character was described as &quot;Sookie Stackhouse variant&quot; in that she talks with animals whole her life and most of other people just assume she is &quot;odd&quot; ( little crazy, rather ). Now she would dwell in to her Fae side, and unlock potential to manipulate Glamour and Wyrd. Only the whole idea of 2ED Fae-Touched is that they made promise to some changeling that was kidnaped and the two's Wyrds are now connected.<br /> <br /> The character in question did not have this. She was born with lesser Contract power ( probably first dot of Fang and Talon ). I think she could be hereditary Fae-Touched, in the way her grandfather become one after the missing of grandmother ( she become changeling ). Grandfather could not fullfil his promise to his wife, he died being Fae-Touched, and passed his promise-obsession on his granddaughter. She was called by the Hegde in the ways of understaing language of animals and beasts - and now, as she traveled to Hedge with rest of motley - she become proper Fae-Touched. Does this seem reasnoable in framework of 2ED?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/ava